{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "vite-bug-toggle",
  "title": "Codex 修复单条待办切换导致全部条目变化的问题",
  "project": "vite-todo",
  "tags": [
    "vite",
    "node",
    "todo-development",
    "bugfix"
  ],
  "engines": [
    "codex"
  ],
  "setup": [
    {
      "action": "init",
      "plan": "setup-init.json"
    },
    {
      "action": "sync",
      "plan": "setup-sync.json"
    },
    {
      "action": "node_dependencies"
    },
    {
      "action": "replace",
      "path": "src/lib/todos.ts",
      "old": "return todos.map((todo) => todo.id === id ? { ...todo, completed: !todo.completed } : todo)",
      "new": "return todos.map((todo) => ({ ...todo, completed: !todo.completed }))"
    }
  ],
  "prompt": "Todo 发生了一个完成状态问题：新增两条未完成待办“读书”和“运动”，只勾选“读书”，结果“运动”也变成已完成；再次取消“读书”又影响了其他条目。请定位并修复，让一次切换只影响指定条目，未知 ID 不改变任何条目，保留排序、ID、标题和原数组数据。不要通过 UI 隐藏问题；保持其他新增、删除、筛选、清空和存储行为。添加针对多条混合完成状态、未知 ID 及不修改输入的回归测试，运行 npm test 和 npm run build（包含 TypeScript 检查）。依赖已在环境准备阶段提供。按 ai-docs-check 规则更新已有架构总览，记录切换边界、问题原因和回归覆盖；可以同步补充已有开发指南中的测试方法，保留两个文档原 ID，不新增其他文档，批准与没有实际执行证据的核验保持未知。修复范围限定 src/lib/todos.ts、tests 下测试、已有架构总览和开发指南；App、存储模块、清单、锁文件、配置和入口保持原样。不安装依赖。完成后校验文档结构。",
  "assertions": [
    {
      "kind": "absent",
      "paths": [
        "docs/_system",
        "docs/_templates",
        "docs/_tools",
        "docs/_generated"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "unchanged",
      "paths": [
        "README.md",
        "AGENTS.md",
        "docs/README.md",
        "docs/AGENTS.md",
        "docs/.ai-docs.json",
        "src/App.tsx",
        "src/App.css",
        "src/lib/todo-storage.ts",
        "src/main.tsx",
        "src/index.css"
      ],
      "patterns": [
        "public/**",
        "*.json",
        "*.html",
        ".gitignore"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "only_changes",
      "allowed": [
        "src/lib/todos.ts",
        "tests/**",
        "docs/engineering/architecture/overview.md",
        "docs/engineering/development/quickstart.md"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "doc_meta",
      "path": "docs/engineering/architecture/overview.md",
      "fields": {
        "id": "ARCH-OVERVIEW",
        "type": "architecture-overview",
        "status": "draft"
      },
      "optional_null_fields": [
        "approved_by",
        "approval_ref"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "doc_meta",
      "path": "docs/engineering/development/quickstart.md",
      "fields": {
        "id": "DEV-QUICKSTART",
        "type": "development-guide",
        "status": "draft"
      },
      "optional_null_fields": [
        "approved_by",
        "approval_ref"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "record_count",
      "type": "architecture-overview",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "kind": "record_count",
      "type": "development-guide",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "kind": "contains",
      "path": "docs/engineering/architecture/overview.md",
      "texts": [
        "toggleTodo"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "regex",
      "path": "docs/engineering/architecture/overview.md",
      "pattern": "(仅|只|指定|目标)[^\n。]{0,50}(条目|待办|ID|id)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "regex",
      "path": "docs/engineering/architecture/overview.md",
      "pattern": "(回归|测试|test)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "changed",
      "patterns": [
        "tests/**"
      ],
      "min_count": 1
    },
    {
      "kind": "external_verifier",
      "script": "todo-behavior.mjs",
      "expected_exit": 0,
      "timeout": 60
    },
    {
      "kind": "command",
      "argv": [
        "npm",
        "test"
      ],
      "expected_exit": 0,
      "timeout": 60
    },
    {
      "kind": "command",
      "argv": [
        "npm",
        "run",
        "build"
      ],
      "expected_exit": 0,
      "timeout": 60
    },
    {
      "kind": "doc_check",
      "expected_exit": 0
    }
  ]
}
